<title>SINGAPORE: Indonesia details March LSWR loading schedule.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details March LSWR loading schedule.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state oil company, Pertamina has announced the loading schedule for its 3.7 million barrel low sulphur waxy residue (LSWR) for lifting in March, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The details of the March loading schedule are as follows (in thousand barrels):</p>
<p>LOADING FROM FLOATING STORAGE PLATINUM (OFF SUMATRA)</p>
<p>    TIMING	VOLUME	 COMPANY</p>
<p>Mar    3-5	   500	 Indoil</p>
<p>     11-13	   350	 British Petroleum (BP)</p>
<p>     11-13	   150	 Perta</p>
<p>     19-21	   300	 BP</p>
<p>     19-21	   200	 Kipco</p>
<p>     26-28	   400	 Perta</p>
<p>    SUB-TOTAL:   1,900</p>
<p>LOADING FROM PAKNING (SUMATRA)</p>
<p>	 6-7	   200	 Pacific Petroleum</p>
<p>     11-13	   200	 Pacific Petroleum</p>
<p>    SUB-TOTAL:     400</p>
<p>    LOADING FROM DUMAI    (SUMATRA)</p>
<p>     29-31	   200	 BP</p>
<p>LOADING FROM SAMBU JETTY</p>
<p>	 1-3	   200	 BP</p>
<p>     22-24	   200	 Indoil</p>
<p>    SUB TOTAL:     400</p>
<p>LOADING FROM BALIKPAPAN (KALIMANTAN, BORNEO)</p>
<p>	 7-9	   200	 Far East Investment (FEI)</p>
<p>     10-12	   200	 FEI</p>
<p>     18-20	   120	 FEI</p>
<p>			  80	 Itochu</p>
<p>     22-24	   100	 Itochu</p>
<p>			 100	 Indoil</p>
<p>    SUB TOTAL:     800</p>
<p>    TOTAL	  3,700</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703086)</p>
</text>
